      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">To ensure you're using your ZOLLER solutions to their full potential, our experienced personnel offer professional commissioning and training for your employees. After all, competent and independent specialists are the basis for success at any company.</p>",
