  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Individually adapted training </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Do you want to be at the cutting edge of technology? Do you want to get the most out of ZOLLER technology? Do you need support with the implementation of tool measuring programs? Are you interested in a tool management system or simply want to learn about new possibilities? Then take part in one of our in-person training courses!</p> <p>The training courses take place either at a ZOLLER branch or at your premises. To ensure maximum learning success, the number of participants is limited to a maximum of 5. </p> <p><strong>Interested in more training?</strong><br/><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/tr/company/contact\" title=\"Kontakt zu ZOLLER\"><strong>Request training</strong></a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/0/csm_training_05_55dada2a8d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1200,
     "h": 1010
    }
   ],
